id: neara.sce.customer_value
stakeholders:
  - SCE operations
  - Neara product
  - Neara customer success
  - utility executive buyer
  - field crew planner
success_criteria:
  - SCE can translate watch points into workforce and budget planning.
  - Neara can reuse the model-delta-to-value pattern for other utility customers.
business_consequence: The model delta can become operational value for SCE and reusable product value for Neara.
risk_opportunity: Reduces translation friction between technical model output and customer adoption.
why_relation: product pattern -> customer value
action_trigger: Recommend productizing the model-delta-to-customer-value translation pattern.
narrative: The model delta matters because it can be translated into SCE operational value and Neara product value.

